* --- PAGETAB16, X'30C0' -- segment 16 ----------------------------------
* Entry 5 is 01100000: a page frame real address above the 16 MB line.
* Everything else in the segment is invalid, so translation landing
* anywhere but page 5 faults rather than quietly working.
r 30C0=00000020000000200000002000000020
